      "update": "join(slice(pluck(data('off_new_reasons'), 'txt'), 0, 2), '; ') + (length(data('off_new_reasons')) > 2 ? '; +' + (length(data('off_new_reasons')) - 2) + ' more' : '')"
    },
    {
      "name": "svFreshStatus",
      "update": "!svInHours ? 'quiet' : !isValid(svLast) ? 'act' : svAgeMin > 180 ? 'act' : svAgeMin > 60 ? 'warn' : 'ok'"
    },
    {
      "name": "svCostStatus",
      "update": "!isValid(svCostLag) ? 'act' : svCostLag >= 4 ? 'act' : svCostLag >= 2 ? 'warn' : 'ok'"
    },
    {
      "name": "svStatus",
      "update": "[svFreshStatus, svCostStatus, ({'1': 'ok', '2': 'warn', '3': 'act'})['' + off_unmapped_rank], ({'1': 'ok', '2': 'warn', '3': 'act'})['' + off_sla_rank], ({'1': 'ok', '2': 'warn', '3': 'act'})['' + off_locks_rank], ({'1': 'ok', '2': 'warn', '3': 'act'})['' + off_workers_rank], ({'1': 'ok', '2': 'warn', '3': 'act'})['' + off_processes_rank], ({'1': 'ok', '2': 'warn', '3': 'act'})['' + off_sys_spike_rank], ({'1': 'ok', '2': 'warn', '3': 'act'})['' + off_new_reasons_rank]]"
    },
    {
      "name": "svHeadline",
      "update": "[(!isValid(svLast) ? 'No updates in 7 days' : (svAgeMin < 90 ? round(svAgeMin) + ' min' : svAgeMin < 2880 ? round(svAgeMin / 60) + ' h' : round(svAgeMin / 1440) + ' days') + ' since the last update'), (!isValid(svCostLast) ? 'No costed days found' : svCostLag <= 0 ? 'Costed to today' : 'Costed to ' + utcFormat(svCostLast, '%d %b') + ' (' + svCostLag + (svCostLag === 1 ? ' day' : ' days') + ' behind)'), (off_unmapped_n ? off_unmapped_n + (off_unmapped_n === 1 ? ' unmapped queue, ' : ' unmapped queues, ') + format(data('sv_unmapped_tot')[0].n, ',') + ' items in 24h' : 'Every queue is in reference data'), (!(data('sv_q_tot').length ? data('sv_q_tot')[0].waiting : 0) ? 'No items waiting' : format((data('sv_q_tot').length ? data('sv_q_tot')[0].waiting : 0), ',') + ' waiting, ' + ((data('sv_q_tot').length ? data('sv_q_tot')[0].past : 0) ? format((data('sv_q_tot').length ? data('sv_q_tot')[0].past : 0), ',') + ' past SLA' : (data('sv_q_tot').length ? data('sv_q_tot')[0].soon : 0) ? format((data('sv_q_tot').length ? data('sv_q_tot')[0].soon : 0), ',') + ' due within 2 h' : 'none near SLA')), (!(data('sv_q_tot').length ? data('sv_q_tot')[0].stuck : 0) ? 'No items locked over 60 min' : (data('sv_q_tot').length ? data('sv_q_tot')[0].stuck : 0) + ' locked over 60 min'), (off_workers_n ? off_workers_n + ' of ' + svWorkers + ' workers quiet' : svWorkers + ' workers active'), (off_processes_n ? off_processes_n + ' running below usual' : svUsualProcs + ' processes on their usual pattern'), (off_sys_spike_n ? off_sys_spike_n + (off_sys_spike_n === 1 ? ' process' : ' processes') + ' above usual' : 'In line with the last 28 days'), (off_new_reasons_n ? off_new_reasons_n + ' new in the last 24 hours' : 'None')]"
    },
    {
      "name": "svDetail",
      "update": "[svFreshStatus === 'quiet' ? 'Outside service hours (07:00 to 19:00 UTC)' : '', '', off_unmapped_detail, off_sla_detail, off_locks_detail, off_workers_detail, off_processes_detail, off_sys_spike_detail, off_new_reasons_detail]"
    },
    {
      "name": "svCount",
      "update": "[0, 0, off_unmapped_n, off_sla_n, off_locks_n, off_workers_n, off_processes_n, off_sys_spike_n, off_new_reasons_n]"
    },
    {
      "name": "svAct",
      "update": "(svStatus[0] === 'act' ? 1 : 0) + (svStatus[1] === 'act' ? 1 : 0) + (svStatus[2] === 'act' ? 1 : 0) + (svStatus[3] === 'act' ? 1 : 0) + (svStatus[4] === 'act' ? 1 : 0) + (svStatus[5] === 'act' ? 1 : 0) + (svStatus[6] === 'act' ? 1 : 0) + (svStatus[7] === 'act' ? 1 : 0) + (svStatus[8] === 'act' ? 1 : 0)"
    },
    {
      "name": "svWarn",
      "update": "(svStatus[0] === 'warn' ? 1 : 0) + (svStatus[1] === 'warn' ? 1 : 0) + (svStatus[2] === 'warn' ? 1 : 0) + (svStatus[3] === 'warn' ? 1 : 0) + (svStatus[4] === 'warn' ? 1 : 0) + (svStatus[5] === 'warn' ? 1 : 0) + (svStatus[6] === 'warn' ? 1 : 0) + (svStatus[7] === 'warn' ? 1 : 0) + (svStatus[8] === 'warn' ? 1 : 0)"
    },
    {
      "name": "oneSpoke",
      "update": "length(data('scope_spokes')) === 1 ? data('scope_spokes')[0].key : ''"
    },
    {
      "name": "tgt_completionPct",
      "update": "oneSpoke && indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'spoke|' + oneSpoke + '|completionPct') >= 0 ? data('tg')[indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'spoke|' + oneSpoke + '|completionPct')].v : (indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'global|completionPct') >= 0 ? data('tg')[indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'global|completionPct')].v : 0.95)"
    },
    {
      "name": "tgt_exceptionRate",
      "update": "oneSpoke && indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'spoke|' + oneSpoke + '|exceptionRate') >= 0 ? data('tg')[indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'spoke|' + oneSpoke + '|exceptionRate')].v : (indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'global|exceptionRate') >= 0 ? data('tg')[indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'global|exceptionRate')].v : 0.06)"
    },
    {
      "name": "tgt_systemRate",
      "update": "oneSpoke && indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'spoke|' + oneSpoke + '|systemRate') >= 0 ? data('tg')[indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'spoke|' + oneSpoke + '|systemRate')].v : (indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'global|systemRate') >= 0 ? data('tg')[indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'global|systemRate')].v : 0.03)"
    },
    {
      "name": "tgt_costPerCase",
      "update": "oneSpoke && indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'spoke|' + oneSpoke + '|costPerCase') >= 0 ? data('tg')[indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'spoke|' + oneSpoke + '|costPerCase')].v : (indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'global|costPerCase') >= 0 ? data('tg')[indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'global|costPerCase')].v : 9)"
    },
    {
      "name": "tgt_utilMin",
      "update": "oneSpoke && indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'spoke|' + oneSpoke + '|utilMin') >= 0 ? data('tg')[indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'spoke|' + oneSpoke + '|utilMin')].v : (indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'global|utilMin') >= 0 ? data('tg')[indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'global|utilMin')].v : 0.15)"
    },
    {
      "name": "tgt_utilMax",
      "update": "oneSpoke && indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'spoke|' + oneSpoke + '|utilMax') >= 0 ? data('tg')[indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'spoke|' + oneSpoke + '|utilMax')].v : (indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'global|utilMax') >= 0 ? data('tg')[indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'global|utilMax')].v : 0.6)"
    },
    {
      "name": "tgt_vdiStaleDays",
      "update": "oneSpoke && indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'spoke|' + oneSpoke + '|vdiStaleDays') >= 0 ? data('tg')[indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'spoke|' + oneSpoke + '|vdiStaleDays')].v : (indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'global|vdiStaleDays') >= 0 ? data('tg')[indexof(pluck(data('tg'), 'k'), 'global|vdiStaleDays')].v : 14)"
    },
    {
      "name": "cfg_fyStart",
      "update": "length(data('ref_config')) ? data('ref_config')[0]._source.fiscal_year_start_month : 4"
    },
    {
      "name": "cfg_warn",
      "update": "length(data('ref_config')) ? data('ref_config')[0]._source.warn_margin : 0.1"
    },
    {
      "name": "headerRight",
      "value": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "top",
      "value": 42
    },
    {
      "name": "cw",
      "update": "width - 32"
    },
    {
      "name": "ch",
      "update": "height - top - 16"
    },
    {
      "name": "hN",
      "update": "max(1, length(data('hubs')))"
    },
    {
      "name": "hMode",
      "update": "hN <= 4 ? 'cards' : 'rows'"
    },
    {
      "name": "rTop",
      "update": "top + 22"
    },
    {
      "name": "rH",
      "update": "clamp((ch - 22) / hN, 30, 56)"
    },
    {
      "name": "rFit",
      "update": "floor((ch - 22) / rH + 0.01)"
    },
    {
      "name": "rNameW",
      "update": "clamp(cw * 0.25, 190, 320)"
    },
    {
      "name": "rFigX",
      "update": "16 + rNameW + 104"
    },
    {
      "name": "rFigW",
      "update": "clamp((cw - rNameW - 104) * 0.17, 96, 150)"
    },
    {
      "name": "rBarX",
      "update": "rFigX + 4 * rFigW + 12"
    },
    {
      "name": "rBarW",
      "update": "16 + cw - rBarX"
    },
    {
      "name": "hCols",
      "update": "hN <= 4 ? hN : ceil(hN / 2)"
    },
    {
      "name": "hRows",
      "update": "ceil(hN / hCols)"
    },
    {
      "name": "hGap",
      "value": 12
    },
    {
      "name": "hW",
      "update": "(cw - (hCols - 1) * hGap) / hCols"
    },
    {
      "name": "hH",
      "update": "(ch - (hRows - 1) * hGap) / hRows"
    },
    {
      "name": "hCpr",
      "update": "hW >= 640 ? 4 : 2"
    },
    {
      "name": "hFigH",
      "update": "ceil(4 / hCpr) * 66"
    },
    {
      "name": "hBars",
      "update": "hH >= 66 + hFigH + 70"
    },
    {
      "name": "hubPick",
      "on": [
        {
          "events": "@hub_card:click, @hub_row:click",
          "update": "kibanaAddFilter({'match_phrase': {'spoke.name': datum.spoke}}, 'ia-workqueue-items*')"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "data": [
    {
      "name": "sv_fresh",
      "url": {
        "index": "ia-workqueue-items",
        "body": {
          "size": 0,
          "query": {
            "range": {
              "item.last_updated_at": {
                "gte": {
                  "%timefilter%": "max",
                  "shift": -168,
                  "unit": "hour"
                },
                "lte": {
                  "%timefilter%": "max"
                },
                "format": "epoch_millis"
              }
            }
          },
          "aggs": {
            "last": {
              "max": {
                "field": "item.last_updated_at"
              }
            },
            "nowb": {
              "date_range": {
                "field": "@timestamp",
                "ranges": [
                  {
                    "key": "now",
                    "from": {
                      "%timefilter%": "max"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "format": {
        "property": "aggregations"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "sv_cost",
      "url": {
        "index": "ia-cost-daily",
        "body": {
          "size": 0,
          "query": {
            "range": {
              "@timestamp": {
                "gte": {
                  "%timefilter%": "max",
                  "shift": -1440,
                  "unit": "hour"
                },
                "lte": {
                  "%timefilter%": "max"
                },
                "format": "epoch_millis"
              }
            }
          },
          "aggs": {
            "last": {
              "max": {
                "field": "@timestamp"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "format": {
        "property": "aggregations"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "sv_vdi",
      "url": {
        "index": "ia-vdi-daily",
        "body": {
          "size": 0,
          "query": {
            "range": {
              "@timestamp": {
                "gte": {
                  "%timefilter%": "max",
                  "shift": -72,
                  "unit": "hour"
                },
                "lte": {
                  "%timefilter%": "max"
                },
                "format": "epoch_millis"
              }
            }
          },
          "aggs": {
            "r": {
              "terms": {
                "field": "resource.name",
                "size": 500
              },
              "aggs": {
                "st": {
                  "terms": {
                    "field": "resource.status",
                    "size": 1
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "format": {
        "property": "aggregations"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "sv_flow",
      "url": {
        "index": "ia-workqueue-items",
        "body": {
          "size": 0,
          "query": {
            "bool": {
              "must": [
                "%dashboard_context-must_clause%",
                {
                  "term": {
                    "mapped": true
                  }
                },
                {
                  "term": {
                    "n.attempt": 1
                  }
                },
                {
                  "range": {
                    "@timestamp": {
                      "gte": {
                        "%timefilter%": "max",
                        "shift": -720,
                        "unit": "hour"
                      },
                      "lte": {
                        "%timefilter%": "max"
                      },
                      "format": "epoch_millis"
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "filter": [
                "%dashboard_context-filter_clause%"
              ],
              "must_not": [
                "%dashboard_context-must_not_clause%"
              ]
            }
          },
          "aggs": {
            "last": {
              "max": {
                "field": "@timestamp"
              }
            },
            "hr": {
              "date_histogram": {
                "field": "@timestamp",
                "fixed_interval": "1h",
                "min_doc_count": 0,
                "extended_bounds": {
                  "min": {
                    "%timefilter%": "max",
                    "shift": -720,
                    "unit": "hour"
                  },
                  "max": {
                    "%timefilter%": "max"
                  }
                }
              },
              "aggs": {
                "a": {
                  "sum": {
                    "field": "n.attempt"
                  }
                },
                "c": {
                  "sum": {
                    "field": "n.completed"
                  }
                },
                "s": {
                  "sum": {
                    "field": "n.system"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "pr": {
              "terms": {
                "field": "process.name",
                "size": 500
              },
              "aggs": {
                "sp": {
                  "terms": {
                    "field": "spoke.name",
                    "size": 1
                  }
                },
                "w": {
                  "filters": {
                    "filters": {
                      "w0": {
                        "range": {
                          "@timestamp": {
                            "gte": {
                              "%timefilter%": "max",
                              "shift": -24,
                              "unit": "hour"
                            },
                            "lte": {
                              "%timefilter%": "max"
                            },
                            "format": "epoch_millis"
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      "w1": {
                        "range": {
                          "@timestamp": {
                            "gte": {
                              "%timefilter%": "max",
                              "shift": -192,
                              "unit": "hour"
                            },
                            "lte": {
                              "%timefilter%": "max",
                              "shift": -168,
                              "unit": "hour"
                            },
                            "format": "epoch_millis"
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      "w2": {
                        "range": {
                          "@timestamp": {
                            "gte": {
                              "%timefilter%": "max",
                              "shift": -360,
                              "unit": "hour"
                            },
                            "lte": {
                              "%timefilter%": "max",
                              "shift": -336,
                              "unit": "hour"
                            },
                            "format": "epoch_millis"
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      "w3": {
                        "range": {
                          "@timestamp": {
                            "gte": {
                              "%timefilter%": "max",
                              "shift": -528,
                              "unit": "hour"
                            },
                            "lte": {
