{"title":"IA · VDI & Capacity · When the work runs","type":"vega","aggs":[],"params":{"spec":"{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega/v5.json",
  "description": "IA · VDI & Capacity · When the work runs. Generated by vega/build.mjs from vega/panels/capacity.mjs, do not edit by hand.",
